OL,3,GNEWSASlimming jab study aims to help
OL,4,Aalcohol dependency
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #2.7m clinical trial will investigate
OL,7,Fif a weight-loss jab can help patients
OL,8,Fliving with alcohol dependency and
OL,9,Fobesity, which the NHS said were two of
OL,10,Fthe biggest causes of liver disease.
OL,12,FThe four-year study will examine the
OL,13,Fimpact of the weight-loss drug
OL,14,Fsemaglutide, which is also known as
OL,15,FWegovy.
OL,17,FTeams in Nottingham and Plymouth are
OL,18,Fleading the research and, from next
OL,19,Fmonth, plan to recruit about 270 NHS
OL,20,Fpatients who are both dependent on
OL,21,Falcohol and obese from across the UK.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
